<div class="MyRobloxContainer">
    <div id="mid-column" class="GroupsPage">
        <div id="description">
            <div class="StandardBox GroupPanelContainer">
            <span class="InsideBoxHeader">Retexture Artists Official Channel</span>
                <div class="left-col">
                    <div class="GroupThumbnail">
                        <a id="ctl00_cphRoblox_GroupDescriptionEmblem" title="Retexture Artists Official Channel" style="display:inline-block;cursor:pointer;"><img src="https://web.archive.org/web/20130528020353im_/http://t1ak.roblox.com/65a2b51d9333aa4e2e451c735caf1610" height="75" width="75" border="0" alt="Retexture Artists Official Channel"></a>
				    </div>
                    <div class="GroupOwner">
                        <div id="ctl00_cphRoblox_OwnershipPanel">
	Owned By:<br> <a style="font-style: italic;" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20130528020353/http://www.roblox.com/user.aspx?id=504316">BrightEyes</a>
</div>
                    </div>
                    <div id="ctl00_cphRoblox_JoinGroup" class="btn-neutral btn-large" style="margin-top:10px;">
	Join Group <span class="btn-text">Join Group</span>
</div>
                    <div></div>
                    
                </div>
                <div class="right-col">
                    <div id="GroupDescP"><pre>The purpose of this group is to help official ROBLOX content creators find high-quality item retextures for asset production. Admission to this group is invitation only. Members should post links to their most recent creations on the wall. Members of the ROBLOX dev team will be through periodically to sort through them. If we publish your retexture, you will be rewarded with a copy of your item or with 500R. We are not interested in publishing a ton of retextures, so we'll be looking for quality. Off-topic discussion, asking for donations, and complaining will get you kicked from the group.</pre></div>
                    <div id="ctl00_cphRoblox_AbuseReportButton_AbuseReportPanel" class="ReportAbuse">
	
    <span class="AbuseIcon"><a id="ctl00_cphRoblox_AbuseReportButton_ReportAbuseIconHyperLink" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20130528020353/http://www.roblox.com/AbuseReport/Group.aspx?ID=27770&amp;RedirectUrl=http%3a%2f%2fwww.roblox.com%2fGroups%2fgroup.aspx%3fgid%3d27770"><img src="https://web.archive.org/web/20130528020353im_/http://www.roblox.com/images/abuse.PNG?v=2" alt="Report Abuse" style="border-width:0px;"></a></span>
    <span class="AbuseButton"><a id="ctl00_cphRoblox_AbuseReportButton_ReportAbuseTextHyperLink" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20130528020353/http://www.roblox.com/AbuseReport/Group.aspx?ID=27770&amp;RedirectUrl=http%3a%2f%2fwww.roblox.com%2fGroups%2fgroup.aspx%3fgid%3d27770">Report Abuse</a></span>

</div><br>
                    
                    <div id="ctl00_cphRoblox_GroupStatusPane_status">
    <div id="ctl00_cphRoblox_GroupStatusPane_StatusView" class="StatusView ">
        <div class="top">
            <span id="ctl00_cphRoblox_GroupStatusPane_StatusTextField" class="StatusTextField">Congrats to DarkGenex and IBarrageI who will have their retextures published for Memorial Day.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bottom">
            <div class="content">
                <a id="ctl00_cphRoblox_GroupStatusPane_StatusPoster" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20130528020353/http://www.roblox.com/User.aspx?id=495650" style="font-style: italic;">IBarrageI</a>
                <span style="color: #808080; font-size: 8px"><span id="ctl00_cphRoblox_GroupStatusPane_StatusDate">5/23/2013 5:22:23 PM</span></span>
